# Accepted vulnerabilities (Trivy skips these IDs in the CI security gate).
# Rules for adding an entry:
#   1. Only after checking it really doesn't affect us.
#   2. Always write WHY and an expiry date, and remove it when a fix ships.
# Format:
#   # <reason> — review by YYYY-MM-DD
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYYY